---
description: Active harness contract for gfunc-skills; read the named profile before harness-dependent work
alwaysApply: true
---

harness=cursor
profile-root=plugin
profile=references/harnesses/cursor.md
Read the named profile before harness-dependent work.

`profile-root=plugin` means the installed plugin root: the directory containing
`.cursor-plugin/`. A skill's own directory at `<plugin-root>/skills/<name>/` is
two levels below it. Cloud children receive this line from the parent and must
not use a local absolute path.
